From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: add PPE Direct Switch Kconfig option

Split out of 906-01 so it applies against the local Kconfig layout.
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/Kconfig
@@ -67,3 +67,11 @@
         depends on THERMAL
         help
           Enable ath12k thermal sensor support.
+
+config ATH12K_PPE_DS_SUPPORT
+	bool "Native Qualcomm PPE Direct Switch transport"
+	depends on ATH12K
+	help
+	  Build the native PPE shared-ring client on Qualcomm platforms.
+	  Requires the matching qcom-ppe Direct Switch API in the kernel.
+	  Automatically activate on platforms with a supported transport.
